  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening safeguarding and preparedness measures for the Odesa Archeological Museum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The work plan takes into account the activities to be undertaken by UNESCO in strengthening, safeguarding and preparedness measures for the Odesa Archaeological Museum. The main set of activities foreseen to be implemented include the establishment/update of the inventorying of the museum collections, digitization of the collections, verification of collection conditions, enhancing storage facilities, improving the institution&apos;s emergency response capacity, and supporting capacity-building for professionals of the Museum. The activities are being undertaken thanks to the financial support of the Foundation of UNESCO Goodwill Ambassador Marc Ladreit de Lacharri&#xE8;re.</narrative>
  </description>
